<div class="content-wrap">

  <div class="content-card">
    <h2>How Many Inches in a Centimeter?</h2>
    <p>There are <strong>0.393701 inches in 1 centimeter</strong>. Conversely, 1 inch = 2.54 cm exactly — this is the international definition of the inch set in 1959.</p>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <div class="answer-row"><span class="answer-lbl">1 cm</span><span class="answer-val">= 0.3937 inches</span></div>
      <div class="answer-row"><span class="answer-lbl">1 inch</span><span class="answer-val">= 2.54 cm</span></div>
      <div class="answer-row"><span class="answer-lbl">1 foot</span><span class="answer-val">= 30.48 cm</span></div>
      <div class="answer-row"><span class="answer-lbl">1 meter</span><span class="answer-val">= 39.37 inches</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="formula-box">inches = cm × 0.393701 &nbsp;|&nbsp; cm = inches × 2.54</div>
  </div>

